      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is irrational to push forward when the odds seem insurmountable, yet the choice to endure your own suffering is yours alone, not a mandate of the world. Even a small resistance against despair can create ripples of relief for a single neighbor who might need a hand just as we do. The math of survival doesn't have to be cold; sometimes it is simply about holding onto each other through the hardest night possible before breaking dawn again.",
